{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entrotria is a turn-based space 4X strategy game with distinctive resource management in which the player takes on the role of one of 12 asymmetrical species competing to conquer the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Spezieswahl.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/759500c1d78e21eded784cc21f57f17c.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Create an empire!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Therefore, you create a thriving civilization by mining raw materials to construct ever larger buildings on your way to rule. Mining and processing the right resources at the right time is a particularly important strategic aspect of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Baubildschirm_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f4eac2bb6f2a53f80ef6c552fbdf17d0.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Exploit planets!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of building upgrades and the development of ever new sources of resources will help you to slowly transform yourself from a nation of constant scarcity to one of prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Upgradebildschirm_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/7c30aec942ddf34213ebaa7cd23c1449.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Your decisions count!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So do you prefer to process the resources you gain into ever higher quality products to generate great prosperity, or do you first invest them in further expansion and even greater dominance? No matter what you decide in the end, a sprawling technology tree is always at your side... Or do you explore the anomalies on your planets first to get special and unique bonuses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Technologiebaum_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/4b52f4d6de356fcc9ad07d0f6f274eb9.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Manage a living universe!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with new goods come new challenges, such as horrendous energy consumption, pollution and, of course, the citizens. Because in Entrotria you don't just manage a sterile empire, but try to lead and provide for a constantly growing population. Grow citizens to unleash the full potential of your buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Individuen.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/00a94cfda7dd64e7da41318d235749a8.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Defy challenges!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with every citizen comes challenges, so make sure they are happy and deal with their political views by promoting or suppressing parties to benefit from their bonuses and keep your citizens happy. Because only with happy individuals will your empire ultimately develop its full economic potential and manage to mature into a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Wahlbildschirm_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/97fe98ec05ff16304a5885d8b3b02a5c.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"And crush your enemies!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But to do this, you must also expand your empire beyond the borders of the starting systems by competing with other players for newly discovered systems and securing your supremacy with your warships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because ultimately we have to decide whether those out there are friends or foes. Whether we want to achieve victory with or despite them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So join forces with like-minded people to expand your economy and destroy those who envy your success in epic spaceship battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Kampf_Kompremiert.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6b5af96a8ba44af232fc7fb488fd4225.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Features:\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 asymmetric species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150+ different hexagon types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">250+ buildings / buildingupgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">complex politics and market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">versatile spaceships and epic space battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you prevail, or will you perish from the maelstrom of greed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9bb13679440433fc209e1d1d66d8496e.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Entrotria awaits you!\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484960?t=1751725861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484960?t=1751725861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/972234cd6500db6083ad15992d231596e3c934d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751725861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/972234cd6500db6083ad15992d231596e3c934d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751725861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entrotria is a turn-based space 4X strategy game with distinctive resource management in which the player takes on the role of one of 12 asymmetrical species competing to conquer the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Spezieswahl.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/759500c1d78e21eded784cc21f57f17c.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Create an empire!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Therefore, you create a thriving civilization by mining raw materials to construct ever larger buildings on your way to rule. Mining and processing the right resources at the right time is a particularly important strategic aspect of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Baubildschirm_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/f4eac2bb6f2a53f80ef6c552fbdf17d0.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Exploit planets!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of building upgrades and the development of ever new sources of resources will help you to slowly transform yourself from a nation of constant scarcity to one of prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Upgradebildschirm_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/7c30aec942ddf34213ebaa7cd23c1449.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Your decisions count!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So do you prefer to process the resources you gain into ever higher quality products to generate great prosperity, or do you first invest them in further expansion and even greater dominance? No matter what you decide in the end, a sprawling technology tree is always at your side... Or do you explore the anomalies on your planets first to get special and unique bonuses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Technologiebaum_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/4b52f4d6de356fcc9ad07d0f6f274eb9.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Manage a living universe!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with new goods come new challenges, such as horrendous energy consumption, pollution and, of course, the citizens. Because in Entrotria you don't just manage a sterile empire, but try to lead and provide for a constantly growing population. Grow citizens to unleash the full potential of your buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Individuen.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/00a94cfda7dd64e7da41318d235749a8.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Defy challenges!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with every citizen comes challenges, so make sure they are happy and deal with their political views by promoting or suppressing parties to benefit from their bonuses and keep your citizens happy. Because only with happy individuals will your empire ultimately develop its full economic potential and manage to mature into a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Wahlbildschirm_EN.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/97fe98ec05ff16304a5885d8b3b02a5c.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"And crush your enemies!\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But to do this, you must also expand your empire beyond the borders of the starting systems by competing with other players for newly discovered systems and securing your supremacy with your warships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because ultimately we have to decide whether those out there are friends or foes. Whether we want to achieve victory with or despite them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So join forces with like-minded people to expand your economy and destroy those who envy your success in epic spaceship battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/Video_Kampf_Kompremiert.gif?t=1751725861\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/6b5af96a8ba44af232fc7fb488fd4225.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Features:\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 asymmetric species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150+ different hexagon types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">250+ buildings / buildingupgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">complex politics and market system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">versatile spaceships and epic space battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you prevail, or will you perish from the maelstrom of greed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/extras/9bb13679440433fc209e1d1d66d8496e.avif?t=1751725861\" alt=\"Entrotria awaits you!\" /></div></p>","developers":["Simon Alber"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/header.jpg?t=1751725861","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112485,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112485/movie480.mp4?t=1751725860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112485/movie_max.mp4?t=1751725860"},"name":"Trailer_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112485/7170dc571d9637beedc4e4bca5c7d91b64d008b6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751725860","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112485/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751725860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112485/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751725860"}}],"name":"Entrotria","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AMD FX - 8370E or equivalent performance<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX Vega 56 or equivalent performance &amp; VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 11700K or AMD Ryzen 7 5700x or equivalent performance<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 3060 or AMD Radeon RX 6600 or equivalent performance &amp; VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Simon Alber"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/400fa6aff13788d8a1d79eba3372c7c15e2b075c/ss_400fa6aff13788d8a1d79eba3372c7c15e2b075c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751725861","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/400fa6aff13788d8a1d79eba3372c7c15e2b075c/ss_400fa6aff13788d8a1d79eba3372c7c15e2b075c.600x338.jpg?t=1751725861"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/1a59f14add48aa78d836513b897244495f644417/ss_1a59f14add48aa78d836513b897244495f644417.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751725861","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/1a59f14add48aa78d836513b897244495f644417/ss_1a59f14add48aa78d836513b897244495f644417.600x338.jpg?t=1751725861"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484960/5cfb1fc6a